1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,132
这是云上一台全新的虚拟机
Here's a fresh virtual machine in the cloud:

2
00:00:03,132 --> 00:00:06,763
没有我们代码的副本，没有虚拟环境，没有 uv
no copy of our code, no virtual environment, no uv.

3
00:00:07,083 --> 00:00:09,835
它只有 Docker，我们只输入一条命令
It has only Docker, and we type one command.

4
00:00:10,155 --> 00:00:12,629
先看就好；最后你会自己跑一遍
Just watch; you'll run it yourself at the end.

5
00:00:12,867 --> 00:00:15,593
Docker 下载了一个 image，一共 7 层
Docker downloads an image, in seven layers,

6
00:00:15,593 --> 00:00:17,432
然后在里面启动一个 shell
and starts a shell inside it.

7
00:00:17,752 --> 00:00:19,252
我们在里面运行这个应用
There we run the app,

8
00:00:19,252 --> 00:00:22,701
它的默认文本 I love cheese 翻成了意大利语
and its default text, I love cheese, comes back in Italian.

9
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:26,619
额外检查一下，README 里没有这一步：这是哪个 Python？
One extra check, not in the README: which Python is this?

10
00:00:26,939 --> 00:00:28,902
是 3.14.7
It's 3.14.7.

11
00:00:29,222 --> 00:00:33,190
可这个 image 的配方是从 Python 3.12 开始的
Yet the recipe for this image starts from Python 3.12.

12
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:36,113
先记住这个问题；今天我们会分两次解开它
Hold that thought; we'll solve it twice today.

13
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:39,614
今天的教程 simple-translate 就在这里收尾
That's where today's tutorial, simple-translate, ends.

14
00:00:39,934 --> 00:00:45,865
上节课我们爬了它的前两级：先在 VM 上手动安装，再用 uv
Last lecture we climbed its first two rungs: a manual install on a VM, then uv.

15
00:00:46,185 --> 00:00:51,158
今天爬另外两级：在笔记本上把应用打包成一个 Docker image
Today, the other two: package the app as a Docker image on your laptop,

16
00:00:51,158 --> 00:00:54,099
push 到 Docker Hub，再在 VM 上运行它
push it to Docker Hub, and run it on a VM.

17
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:57,576
想跟着做的话，把 README 打开，放在视频旁边
To follow along, open the README beside this video.

18
00:00:57,896 --> 00:01:00,846
左上角的三个进度条显示我们在哪儿
Three trackers, top left, show where we are:

19
00:01:00,846 --> 00:01:03,528
在笔记本上，在 Docker Hub 上，还是在 VM 上
on the laptop, on Docker Hub, on the VM.

20
00:01:03,848 --> 00:01:08,077
看到黄色的 your turn 标签，就暂停，自己跑这条命令
When the yellow your-turn tag appears, pause and run the command;

21
00:01:08,077 --> 00:01:11,720
灰色的 extra 标签表示这个检查 README 里没有
a gray extra tag marks a check that isn't in the README.

22
00:01:11,967 --> 00:01:15,777
你需要运行中的 Docker Desktop、一个免费的 Docker Hub 账号
You need Docker Desktop running, a free Docker Hub account,

23
00:01:15,777 --> 00:01:19,135
还有你的 Google Cloud 项目，最后开 VM 要用
and your Google Cloud project for the VM at the end.

24
00:01:19,455 --> 00:01:21,652
今天不需要服务账号，也不需要密钥
No service account or keys today.

25
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:24,983
先来看贯穿整节课的四个词
First, four words for the whole lecture.

26
00:01:25,303 --> 00:01:28,817
在第 1 讲里，每台新 VM 都要把同样的配置再做一遍
In lecture 1, every new VM needed the same setup,

27
00:01:28,817 --> 00:01:32,044
而且是在一个得配合才行的操作系统上
on an operating system that had to cooperate.

28
00:01:32,364 --> 00:01:36,212
Docker image 把这些全装进一个能复制的东西
A Docker image packs it all into one thing you can copy:

29
00:01:36,212 --> 00:01:39,511
系统文件、Python、各种包和代码
system files, Python, the packages and the code.

30
00:01:39,750 --> 00:01:42,459
一个 image 就是一叠只读层
An image is a stack of read-only layers.

31
00:01:42,779 --> 00:01:46,961
每一层放的是某个构建步骤新增或改动的文件
Each layer holds the files added or changed by one build step.

32
00:01:47,281 --> 00:01:49,581
旁边还有一张小小的配置卡片
Beside it sits a small config card:

33
00:01:49,581 --> 00:01:53,787
放环境变量这类设置，还有要启动哪个程序
settings like environment variables, and which program to start.

34
00:01:54,033 --> 00:01:57,830
配方就是 Dockerfile，Docker 一次读一条指令
The recipe is a Dockerfile, read one instruction at a time.

35
00:01:58,150 --> 00:02:02,161
会改文件的指令，比如 RUN 和 COPY，会加一层
Instructions that change files, like RUN and COPY, add a layer.

36
00:02:02,481 --> 00:02:05,425
别的指令，比如 CMD，只写在卡片上
Others, like CMD, only write on the card.

37
00:02:05,667 --> 00:02:08,175
运行一个 image，就得到一个 container
Run an image and you get a container:

38
00:02:08,175 --> 00:02:13,667
共用同样那几层，最上面再加一层薄薄的可写层，外加一个主进程
the same layers, shared, plus a thin writable layer on top, and one main process.

39
00:02:13,987 --> 00:02:17,315
进程结束，container 就停了
When that process ends, the container stops,

40
00:02:17,315 --> 00:02:20,643
而 --rm 会把它删掉，连同可写层一起
and --rm deletes it, writable layer and all.

41
00:02:20,963 --> 00:02:22,755
而 image 从来不变
The image never changes.

42
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:26,883
可以把 image 想成一个类，每个 container 就是一个实例
Think of the image as a class, and each container as an instance.

43
00:02:27,203 --> 00:02:31,171
README 里有一个小疏漏：它说要构建 docker container
One small slip in the README: it says build the docker container.

44
00:02:31,491 --> 00:02:34,563
构建得到的是 image；运行得到的才是 container
Building makes an image; running makes a container.

45
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:39,173
像 Docker Hub 这样的 registry，按名字把 image 存在货架上
A registry, like Docker Hub, stores images by name, on shelves.

46
00:02:39,493 --> 00:02:42,971
所谓 tag，就是指向某一个 image 的名字，比如 latest
A tag is a name that points at one image, such as latest.

47
00:02:43,217 --> 00:02:45,670
而且，container 不是一台小 VM
And a container is not a small VM.

48
00:02:45,990 --> 00:02:50,065
VM 会启动自己的内核，也就是操作系统的核心
A VM boots its own kernel, the core of the operating system.

49
00:02:50,385 --> 00:02:54,587
而 container 是一些相互隔离的进程，共用同一个 Linux 内核
Containers are isolated processes that share one Linux kernel.

50
00:02:54,983 --> 00:02:56,822
在 Mac 或 Windows 笔记本上
On a Mac or Windows laptop,

51
00:02:56,822 --> 00:03:01,319
Docker Desktop 靠一台隐藏的小 Linux VM，来提供这个内核
Docker Desktop provides that kernel with a small, hidden Linux VM.

52
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:05,671
在云上的 VM 里，Docker 直接跑在 VM 自己的 Linux 上
On a cloud VM, Docker runs right on the VM's own Linux.

53
00:03:05,917 --> 00:03:11,194
第 1 讲里 venv 隔离不了的东西，也就是系统文件和库
What a venv couldn't isolate in lecture 1, the system's files and libraries,

54
00:03:11,194 --> 00:03:12,794
现在都装进了盒子里
is now inside the box.

55
00:03:13,042 --> 00:03:15,666
GPU 驱动还是来自宿主机
GPU drivers still come from the host.

56
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:18,509
现在进入 README 的这一节
Now the README section Developing App using Containers.

57
00:03:18,509 --> 00:03:20,676
Developing App using Containers
Now the README section Developing App using Containers.

58
00:03:20,996 --> 00:03:23,044
在你的笔记本上打开一个终端
Open a terminal on your laptop.

59
00:03:23,364 --> 00:03:26,152
在 Mac 上，你的提示符会不一样
On a Mac your prompt looks different;

60
00:03:26,152 --> 00:03:30,297
在 Windows 上，用 WSL 里的 Ubuntu 终端，或者 Git Bash
on Windows, use an Ubuntu terminal in WSL, or Git Bash.

61
00:03:30,617 --> 00:03:34,106
在 Git Bash 里，docker run 前面要加上 winpty
In Git Bash, put winpty in front of docker run

62
00:03:34,106 --> 00:03:36,761
如果它报 stdin is not a terminal 的话
if it says stdin is not a terminal.

63
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:40,392
首先，docker container ls 列出正在运行的 container
First, docker container ls lists running containers.

64
00:03:40,712 --> 00:03:43,677
这里只显示了表头，所以什么都没在运行
Here it shows only the header, so nothing is running.

65
00:03:43,997 --> 00:03:46,706
如果你那边连不上 Docker daemon
If yours can't connect to the Docker daemon,

66
00:03:46,706 --> 00:03:48,861
就启动 Docker Desktop 再试
start Docker Desktop and try again.

67
00:03:49,181 --> 00:03:50,533
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

68
00:03:50,583 --> 00:03:52,844
接着，停掉所有正在运行的 container
Next, stop any running container.

69
00:03:53,164 --> 00:03:57,794
这里没有要停的；如果你有，docker stop 加上它的 ID 就行
There's nothing to stop here; if you have one, docker stop with its ID does it.

70
00:03:58,033 --> 00:03:59,700
然后是 docker system prune
Then docker system prune.

71
00:03:59,996 --> 00:04:02,982
它会列出要删掉的东西，再问你；输入 y
It lists what it will remove and asks; type y.

72
00:04:03,302 --> 00:04:04,878
这里没有空间可回收
Nothing to reclaim here;

73
00:04:04,878 --> 00:04:07,925
你那边可能会删掉一个停了的 hello-world container
yours may delete the stopped hello-world container

74
00:04:07,925 --> 00:04:09,482
是 Tutorial 0 留下的
from Tutorial 0.

75
00:04:09,532 --> 00:04:10,883
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

76
00:04:10,933 --> 00:04:14,944
看第三项：dangling images，也就是没有名字的 image
Look at the third item: dangling images, the ones without a name.

77
00:04:15,264 --> 00:04:18,403
别看 README 的标题那么写，有名字的 image 其实会留下来
Despite the README's heading, named images survive.

78
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:22,027
加上 -a 的话，prune 会删掉所有没在用的 image
With -a, prune would remove every unused image.

79
00:04:22,267 --> 00:04:25,104
然后，docker image ls 列出你的 image
Then docker image ls lists your images.

80
00:04:25,424 --> 00:04:26,868
这里列表是空的
The list is empty here;

81
00:04:26,868 --> 00:04:30,886
你那边可能还会显示 hello-world：它有名字，所以留了下来
yours may still show hello-world: it has a name, so it survived.

82
00:04:31,206 --> 00:04:36,112
你看到的列可能不一样：这是录制时的 Docker 29
Your columns may differ: this is Docker 29, at the time of recording.

83
00:04:36,350 --> 00:04:37,687
接下来是代码
Now the code.

84
00:04:37,737 --> 00:04:42,249
README 也提醒了，上节课在 VM 上 clone 的那份帮不上忙
As the README notes, a clone on last lecture's VM doesn't help:

85
00:04:42,249 --> 00:04:44,755
Docker Desktop 跑在你的笔记本上
Docker Desktop runs on your laptop.

86
00:04:45,075 --> 00:04:48,019
在这里 clone，然后 cd 进 simple-translate
Clone it here, then cd into simple-translate.

87
00:04:48,339 --> 00:04:49,833
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

88
00:04:49,883 --> 00:04:53,104
额外检查一下，README 里没有这一步：ls -a
An extra check, not in the README: ls -a.

89
00:04:53,424 --> 00:04:56,447
参考答案 Dockerfile.txt 在这儿
There's the solution, Dockerfile.txt,

90
00:04:56,447 --> 00:05:00,614
但没有一个就叫 Dockerfile 的文件，也没有 uv.lock
but no file called just Dockerfile, and no uv.lock.

91
00:05:00,850 --> 00:05:04,060
现在就跑一下 README 里的构建命令，这是额外的一步
Run the README's build command now, as an extra:

92
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:05,799
报 failed to read dockerfile
failed to read dockerfile.

93
00:05:06,119 --> 00:05:08,850
README 是要你自己写这个文件，分五步
The README wants you to write it, in five steps.

94
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:12,783
接下来，在 simple-translate 目录里
Next, inside the simple-translate folder,

95
00:05:12,783 --> 00:05:16,791
建一个叫 Dockerfile 的文件：大写 D，没有扩展名
create a file called Dockerfile: capital D, no extension.

96
00:05:17,111 --> 00:05:21,420
README 分五步把它填满，每一步之后都构建一次、运行一次
The README fills it in five steps, with a build and a run after each.

97
00:05:21,740 --> 00:05:23,383
暂停一下，把文件建好
Pause and create the file.

98
00:05:23,617 --> 00:05:26,740
Dockerfile 的第 1 步只有一条指令
Dockerfile step 1 is one instruction:

99
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:29,356
FROM python:3.12-slim-bookworm
FROM python:3.12-slim-bookworm.

100
00:05:29,676 --> 00:05:31,829
这是官方的 Python image
That's the official Python image,

101
00:05:31,829 --> 00:05:34,177
基于精简版的 Debian 12，代号 bookworm
on a slim Debian 12 called bookworm.

102
00:05:34,497 --> 00:05:37,441
粘贴进去，保存，再用 cat 检查一下，这是额外的一步
Paste it in, save, and check with cat, an extra.

103
00:05:37,683 --> 00:05:39,283
接下来是构建命令
Now the build command.

104
00:05:39,368 --> 00:05:43,976
参数 -t 给 image 取名 simple-translate；-f 指定配方
-t names the image simple-translate; -f picks the recipe.

105
00:05:44,296 --> 00:05:47,599
末尾那个点就是构建上下文，也就是这个目录
And the final dot is the build context: this folder,

106
00:05:47,599 --> 00:05:49,758
Docker 会把它发给构建器
which Docker sends to the builder.

107
00:05:50,078 --> 00:05:52,083
第 3 步会说明这为什么重要
Step 3 shows why that matters.

108
00:05:52,333 --> 00:05:53,933
暂停一下，跑一下构建
Pause and run the build.

109
00:05:54,146 --> 00:05:56,216
你的终端显示的是精简视图
Your terminal shows a compact view.

110
00:05:56,536 --> 00:05:58,697
这里看到的是完整日志
Here you see the full log;

111
00:05:58,697 --> 00:06:01,357
要看到它，就加上 --progress 参数，设成 plain
to get it, add --progress=plain.

112
00:06:01,677 --> 00:06:03,177
在 Docker Desktop 上
On Docker Desktop,

113
00:06:03,177 --> 00:06:06,307
构建器叫 desktop-linux，不叫 default
the builder is called desktop-linux, not default.

114
00:06:06,550 --> 00:06:11,614
Docker 下载了 base image：4 层，压缩后不到 50 MB
Docker fetches the base image, four layers, under 50 megabytes compressed,

115
00:06:11,614 --> 00:06:15,446
然后把结果存为 simple-translate，tag 是 latest
and saves the result as simple-translate, tagged latest.

116
00:06:15,766 --> 00:06:18,262
这 4 层就是我们这叠层的最底部
Those four layers are the bottom of our stack.

117
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:20,100
它启动的时候会做什么？
What will it do when it starts?

118
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:24,234
额外用 docker image inspect 读一下配置卡片
An extra docker image inspect reads the config card:

119
00:06:24,234 --> 00:06:25,627
没有 ENTRYPOINT
no entrypoint,

120
00:06:25,627 --> 00:06:29,295
CMD 是 python3，是从 base image 继承来的
and the command python3, inherited from the base image.

121
00:06:29,615 --> 00:06:31,548
所以我们预测会出现 Python 提示符
So we predict a Python prompt.

122
00:06:31,733 --> 00:06:37,450
现在是运行命令：docker run --rm -ti simple-translate
Now the run command: docker run --rm -ti simple-translate.

123
00:06:37,770 --> 00:06:42,656
其中 --rm 负责事后清理；-ti 让你能往里面输入
--rm cleans up afterwards; -ti lets you type into it.

124
00:06:42,976 --> 00:06:44,398
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

125
00:06:44,448 --> 00:06:48,864
Python 提示符出来了，录制时是 3.12.15
There's the Python prompt, 3.12.15 at the time of recording.

126
00:06:49,184 --> 00:06:51,445
输入带括号的 exit 退出
Type exit() to leave.

127
00:06:51,683 --> 00:06:54,153
有个意外：额外用 git status 看一下
One surprise: an extra git status says

128
00:06:54,153 --> 00:06:57,144
显示 nothing to commit，可我们刚建了一个文件
nothing to commit, though we just made a file.

129
00:06:57,464 --> 00:07:00,603
这里的 .gitignore 文件第 3 行写着 Dockerfile
The .gitignore file here lists Dockerfile on line 3,

130
00:07:00,603 --> 00:07:02,203
所以 git 把你的忽略了
so git hides yours.

131
00:07:02,371 --> 00:07:05,081
想照样 commit 它，就用 git add -f
To commit it anyway, use git add -f.

132
00:07:06,117 --> 00:07:10,213
第 2 步加一行：ENTRYPOINT /bin/bash
Step 2 adds one line: ENTRYPOINT /bin/bash.

133
00:07:10,533 --> 00:07:12,581
放在 FROM 那一行下面，保存
Put it under the FROM line, and save.

134
00:07:12,817 --> 00:07:14,417
暂停一下，再构建一次
Pause and build again.

135
00:07:14,524 --> 00:07:19,004
FROM 那一步显示 CACHED：什么都没下载，也没有加层
The FROM step says CACHED: nothing is downloaded, and no layer is added.

136
00:07:19,324 --> 00:07:22,118
ENTRYPOINT 只写在配置卡片上
ENTRYPOINT only writes on the config card.

137
00:07:22,367 --> 00:07:25,548
可以把 ENTRYPOINT 想成要启动的程序
Think of ENTRYPOINT as the program to start,

138
00:07:25,548 --> 00:07:27,935
把 CMD 想成它的默认参数
and CMD as its default arguments.

139
00:07:28,255 --> 00:07:32,714
现在 ENTRYPOINT 是 bash，而 CMD 那一格还写着 python3
The entrypoint is now bash, and the command slot still says python3.

140
00:07:33,034 --> 00:07:36,212
那么 container 会启动 bash，再让它运行 python3 吗？
So will the container start bash, running python3?

141
00:07:36,450 --> 00:07:38,265
这个额外的 inspect 说不会
This extra inspect says no:

142
00:07:38,265 --> 00:07:41,762
ENTRYPOINT 是 bash，CMD 现在是 null
the entrypoint is bash, and the command is now null.

143
00:07:42,082 --> 00:07:46,541
一设置 ENTRYPOINT，从 base image 继承来的 CMD 就被清空了
Setting an entrypoint resets the command you inherited from the base image.

144
00:07:46,861 --> 00:07:48,568
所以启动的就只有 bash 本身
So bash starts on its own.

145
00:07:48,817 --> 00:07:51,372
暂停一下，自己跑一遍：只有一个光秃秃的提示符
Pause and run it: a bare prompt.

146
00:07:51,422 --> 00:07:52,863
从左往右读
Read it left to right.

147
00:07:52,913 --> 00:07:55,985
你是 root，也就是 container 里的管理员
You're root, the administrator, inside the container.

148
00:07:56,305 --> 00:07:59,237
@ 符号后面是 container 的 ID
After the @ sign comes the container's ID,

149
00:07:59,237 --> 00:08:02,449
每次运行都不一样，所以你的会不同
which changes every run, so yours will differ.

150
00:08:02,684 --> 00:08:06,452
而那个斜杠表示你从 image 的根目录开始
And the slash means you start in the top folder of the image,

151
00:08:06,452 --> 00:08:09,233
因为这个 image 没有设置工作目录
because this image sets no working directory.

152
00:08:09,553 --> 00:08:11,153
输入 exit 退出
Type exit to leave.

153
00:08:11,983 --> 00:08:14,031
第 3 步加两条指令
Step 3 adds two instructions.

154
00:08:14,351 --> 00:08:19,407
RUN pip install uv：用 base image 自带的 pip 来装 uv
RUN pip install uv uses the pip of the base image to install uv.

