00:08:44,149 --> 00:08:45,749
但这个 repo 里没有
but this repo has none.

164
00:08:46,041 --> 00:08:49,604
COPY 那一行把它全部拆开，放进 image 的根目录
The COPY line unpacks it all into the image's top folder.

