00:11:36,398 --> 00:11:40,387
所以 python 这个词会先找到 /usr/local/bin 里的 Python
so the word python first finds the Python in /usr/local/bin,

207
00:11:40,387 --> 00:11:41,987
它来自 base image
from the base image.

