Words after the image name replace CMD, and only CMD.

291
00:16:15,134 --> 00:16:18,761
所以 container 运行的是：/bin/bash python cli.py
So the container runs /bin/bash python cli.py.

292
00:16:19,081 --> 00:16:21,376
于是 bash 把 python 当成脚本名
Bash takes python as a script name,

293
00:16:21,376 --> 00:16:24,457
在 /usr/local/bin 里找到了 Python 程序
and finds the Python program in /usr/local/bin.

